{
  "contract": "identifiers",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Conformance corpus for standards/identifiers.md. 'validity': the value must validate (or fail) against the named $def in primitives.schema.json. 'canonical': the implementation parses 'input' as the named kind and must emit exactly 'emit'. An implementation passes the whole file or names the case it fails.",
  "validity": [
